5,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need to stop guessing. I want to know what an even split actually costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. I’m curious about what actually sours groups like ours.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I care about the car’s state when I pick it up.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I need the real figures. No more guesswork on fuel or bills.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to see where the arranging time goes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, your figures will help me see the subsidy issue.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, I’ll look into past conflicts to avoid repeating them.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, if we track hours, we might see the handover issues.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, knowing what sours us helps me judge the logic.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Asuka, I’ll try to find the time cost of coordination.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,Let’s pick two things each. I’ll take the fuel receipts and the diary.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll check the other households and our own checking spell.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll look at the handover state and the weekly trips.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I’ll take the tax papers and the fuel receipts.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look at the trial recording and the heavy use weeks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,Sounds fair. Let’s see what the data says.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I hope it’s not just more blame.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
