35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The fuel is lopsided. Two people bought most of it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,I found that asking favours sours groups. Checking figures made us feel accused.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The car is often dirty or empty when I need it. Weekly trips keep failing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,Fixed costs are 280k yen. Fuel is uneven. We need a system that reflects use.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Tracking takes an hour a week. Heavy weeks cost whole evenings. It’s exhausting.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, if fuel is uneven, a fixed share is unfair.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, so we need a system that doesn’t feel like asking favours.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, a booking system might stop the weekly trips from collapsing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, a booking system with distance-based costs seems logical.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, but if it takes an hour a week to track, is it worth it?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,I think a booking calendar with distance costs is fair.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. It avoids the favour-asking dynamic.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I prefer it too. It ensures the car is ready for my weekly trips.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"I support it. It uses real figures, not guesses.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m worried about the time cost, but it seems the fairest.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,Let’s vote on the options.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll vote for the booking calendar.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,Same here.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,I’ll vote for the booking calendar.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I’ll vote for the booking calendar, hoping it’s manageable.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
